                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In the days of his flesh, Jesus",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Greek",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "he",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " offered up prayers and supplications, with loud cries and tears, to him who was able to save him from death, and he was heard for his godly fear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Although he was a Son, he learned obedience through what he suffered; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 45.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and being made perfect he became the source of eternal salvation to all who obey him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 110.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " being designated by God a high priest after the order of Melchizedek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "About this we have much to say which is hard to explain, since you have become dull of hearing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For though by this time you ought to be teachers, you need some one to teach you again the first principles of God's word. You need milk, not solid food; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for every one who lives on milk is unskilled in the word of righteousness, for he is a child. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But solid food is for the mature, for those who have their faculties trained by practice to distinguish good from evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
